WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:04.870
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.870 --> 00:00:06.770
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:09.070
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:12.940
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.940 --> 00:00:16.780
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:20.340
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:27.690
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.690 --> 00:00:31.590
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:36.960
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.870
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.200
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:54.720
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.720 --> 00:01:00.450
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:10.450
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:18.270
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:23.580
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:27.250
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:32.750
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:38.460
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.460 --> 00:01:44.700
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:51.100
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:57.210
What great weather!

00:01:57.210 --> 00:01:58.550
If we keep going this way,

00:01:58.550 --> 00:02:01.350
we should see the
navy base island soon!

00:02:01.350 --> 00:02:03.980
Wow, Coby!
You're amazing!

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:05.650
We're actually gonna
reach our destination?

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:06.820
But of course!

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:09.660
These are the bare minimum
skills all sailors need!

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:14.660
<i>This is no time
to be laughing, Luffy-san.</i>

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:17.100
He's being held prisoner there.

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:20.270
The famous pirate hunter...

00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:22.930
Roronoa Zoro!

00:02:25.810 --> 00:02:33.080
The man who's chopped up bounties
like a bloodthirsty beast...

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:37.380
People say he's a demon
in human form!

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:46.420
"Enter the Great Swordsman!
Pirate Hunter Roronoa Zoro"

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:55.230
We made it!
The navy base city!

00:02:59.870 --> 00:03:01.440
<i>Seriously, Luffy-san!</i>

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:04.310
You're crazy to want
him to join you!

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:07.250
I still haven't decided yet.
I just wanna see if he's a good guy...

00:03:07.250 --> 00:03:09.910
He's been caught because
he's a bad guy!

00:03:13.020 --> 00:03:15.020
Mm! Yum!

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.690
Do you know if Zoro's at the base?

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:26.970
It would seem the name "Zoro"
is taboo here...

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.670
Well, let's check out
the base anyway.

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:30.440
You're gonna be a marine, right?

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:33.940
Y-yes... But I'm not
really ready yet...

00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:35.080
Rumor has it...

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:38.270
...a guy named Captain Morgan
is at this base, and...

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:46.590
What a funny town!

00:03:46.590 --> 00:03:48.060
It's strange...

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:52.690
I understand Zoro, but why are they
afraid of a navy captain's name?

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:55.560
I suddenly feel uneasy about this...

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:58.000
You sure they didn't jump
just for fun?

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:01.540
Nobody would do that!

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:04.000
Alright! This's the place!

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:07.140
I'm finally here!

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:09.440
<i>I guess this is where
we part ways, Luffy-san.</i>

00:04:09.440 --> 00:04:12.010
It was only for a short time, but...

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:13.510
Upsy-daisy!

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:15.650
<i>Luffy-san! What in the world
are you doing?!</i>

00:04:15.650 --> 00:04:18.350
Now where's this demon?!

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:20.520
He wouldn't be out here.

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:22.620
I'm sure he's in
a prison cell or something...

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:23.620
There he is!

00:04:23.620 --> 00:04:24.850
Alright!

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:28.660
See! There he is!

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:31.150
Yeah, right!
He wouldn't be out-

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:40.160
<i>A black hood and a haramaki...</i>

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:45.210
<i>That's Roronoa Zoro!</i>

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:47.720
He can get away easy if
we untie those ropes!

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.950
D-don't be stupid!

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:52.050
There's no telling what'll
happen if we let him loose!

00:04:52.050 --> 00:04:54.920
<i>I bet he'd try to kill you too,
Luffy-san!</i>

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:57.020
Don't worry! I'm strong!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:04:59.790
<i>I can't believe this guy!</i>

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:01.660
Hey, you guys.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.890
You're an eyesore.

00:05:06.800 --> 00:05:08.130
Get lost!

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:12.900
<i>Luffy-san! There's no way you could
survive with him on your crew!</i>

00:05:23.780 --> 00:05:25.950
<i>Oh no!
Stop her, Luffy-san!</i>

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:27.790
She'll be killed!

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:30.020
What?

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:33.860
You must be hungry!
I made you some rice balls!

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:36.530
<i>Do you wanna get killed,
pipsqueak? Scram!</i>

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:39.570
You haven't eaten anything
this whole time.

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:42.870
Here! This is my first time,

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:46.610
but I worked really hard
to make them!

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.480
I ain't hungry!

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:50.210
You're an eyesore!
Get the hell outta here!

00:05:50.210 --> 00:05:50.880
But...

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:53.950
I don't want 'em!
Don't make me kick your ass!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.210
It's not nice to be a bully!

00:05:59.390 --> 00:06:03.220
You seem surprisingly well,
Roronoa Zoro...

00:06:03.220 --> 00:06:05.360
Now there's another weird guy!

00:06:05.360 --> 00:06:06.560
Thank goodness!

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:10.500
He must be with the navy!
Now that girl will be safe!

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:13.730
Oh? Those are some
tasty-looking rice balls.

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:15.070
Stop!

00:06:17.370 --> 00:06:18.740
Too damn sweet!

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:20.140
Those're full of sugar!

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:22.440
You're supposed
to use salt for rice balls!

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:26.580
But I thought they
might taste better sweet...

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:29.080
--Take this! And this!
--Stop! Stop!

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:31.420
H-how horrible!

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:40.230
And I worked so hard
to make those...

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:45.330
Did you not read this notice?

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:48.940
"Those who help criminals
will be executed!

00:06:48.940 --> 00:06:50.930
Navy Captain Morgan"

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:56.740
Looks like even little brats
know how scary my dad is!

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:57.950
Dad?

00:06:57.950 --> 00:07:01.020
Then that's Captain Morgan's son?!

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:03.080
You. Throw this kid out.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.050
Sir?!

00:07:05.050 --> 00:07:07.760
I said throw her over the wall!

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:11.060
Or can you not follow my orders?!
Don't make me tell my dad!

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:13.050
Y-yes, sir!
Right away!

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:15.500
No!

00:07:15.500 --> 00:07:19.520
I- I'm sorry, little girl.
Curl yourself into a ball.

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:29.310
T-thanks...

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:31.710
<i>Are you all right, Luffy-san?!</i>

00:07:31.710 --> 00:07:33.550
Are you all right?!

00:07:33.550 --> 00:07:35.880
I can't believe how
horrible that guy is!

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.090
Do you hurt anywhere?

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:39.420
Damn you...

00:07:43.320 --> 00:07:46.960
You sure are stubborn about
staying alive...

00:07:46.960 --> 00:07:50.230
<i>Yeah! I will live the full month!</i>

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:52.560
Well, good luck with that.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.100
Ten days left, you know!

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:59.770
Assuming you can
live that long!

00:08:01.740 --> 00:08:05.850
<i>How can he be so cruel, Luffy-san?!</i>

00:08:05.850 --> 00:08:07.710
He's gone?!

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:11.750
I hear you're a bad guy.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:13.350
<i>Are you still here?</i>

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:15.890
Being stuck out here
for all to see...

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:17.390
Are you really
strong at all?!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:18.880
Mind your own business!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:24.900
If it were me, I'd probably
starve to death in three days!

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:28.340
I got more spirit than you.

00:08:28.340 --> 00:08:31.410
<i>I will live through this...</i>

00:08:31.410 --> 00:08:34.310
I swear it!

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:35.640
What a strange person!

00:08:35.640 --> 00:08:37.950
Wait!

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:41.520
Could you pick that up for me?

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:43.450
You're gonna eat this?

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:45.390
It's mostly a mud ball now.

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:47.380
Just shut up and give it here!

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.000
Told you so.

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.700
It was good.

00:08:57.700 --> 00:08:59.530
Thanks for the food.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:03.370
Really?!

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:07.040
Yeah! He ate every last bite!

00:09:07.040 --> 00:09:08.310
I'm so happy!

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:12.050
Is Zoro really as evil
as the rumors say?

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:13.710
No!

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:18.490
After all, he let himself
get crucified in our place...

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:20.950
Huh? What do you mean?

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:24.830
It's all that Helmeppo's fault.

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:28.760
He's Captain Morgan's son...

00:09:28.760 --> 00:09:30.400
Outta the way!

00:09:30.400 --> 00:09:34.400
<i>Make way for
my adorable pet-sama!</i>

00:09:34.400 --> 00:09:36.730
Get in the way,
and you get executed!

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.380
No! Stop that!

00:09:45.380 --> 00:09:46.750
Hey, you!

00:09:46.750 --> 00:09:49.980
<i>You gonna complain about
what my pet-sama's doin'?!</i>

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:51.420
Rika! Stop that!

00:09:51.420 --> 00:09:53.410
We'll get in trouble
if we go against him!

00:09:59.860 --> 00:10:03.090
--Oh, crap!
--He's in trouble now!

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:06.870
<i>Who the hell are you?!</i>

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:08.870
Don't tell me you're...

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:10.870
...pirate hunter Zoro?

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:12.740
And if I am?

00:10:12.740 --> 00:10:15.680
Why is a pirate hunter
defying the navy?!

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.110
Just shut up and let me
eat in peace!

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:20.580
Why, you...

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:36.760
<i>You're annoying me.
Both you and your pet-sama!</i>

00:10:41.440 --> 00:10:45.470
<i>You do realize that if my
dad finds out about this,</i>

00:10:45.470 --> 00:10:48.030
they're gonna get
executed for sure!

00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:54.250
Whadya say?
Let's make a deal!

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:58.050
You get strung up in place
of this mother and daughter!

00:10:58.050 --> 00:11:00.550
For, yeah, one month...

00:11:00.550 --> 00:11:02.260
If you can survive
for one month,

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:05.760
I'll let you live, too.

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:07.420
Whadya say?

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:10.560
One month.

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.490
It's been three weeks
since then.

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:22.610
Helmeppo punches and kicks
him while he's tied up!

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:25.150
I... I...

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:26.980
I see...

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:33.690
I'm hungry!
Let us all eat for free!

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.390
Hey! Bring me some booze!

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:41.390
Quit dawdling! Hurry it up!

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:44.360
Oh, yes.

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:46.030
I've been bored lately,

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:48.540
so I've decided
to execute Zoro tomorrow.

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:50.530
Look forward to it!

00:11:59.880 --> 00:12:01.520
W-what the hell're you doing?!

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:03.750
<i>Luffy-san! Please stop!</i>

00:12:03.750 --> 00:12:05.190
This guy is scum!

00:12:05.190 --> 00:12:07.090
Y-you hit me!

00:12:07.090 --> 00:12:09.620
I'm Captain Morgan's son,
you know!

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.190
So what?!

00:12:11.190 --> 00:12:14.030
I'm gonna tell my dad
and he's gonna execute you!

00:12:14.030 --> 00:12:16.030
Fight me yourself!

00:12:16.030 --> 00:12:17.530
<i>Luffy-san! Calm down!</i>

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:19.730
Are you trying to get
on the navy's bad side?!

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.220
I've made up my mind, Coby!

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:26.500
I'm... going to have Zoro
join my crew!

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:33.280
I am...

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:34.650
great!

00:12:34.650 --> 00:12:37.550
Yes! You're exactly right,
Captain Morgan, sir!

00:12:37.550 --> 00:12:41.790
But hasn't tribute to me
been a bit lacking lately?

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:47.290
<i>W-well, the citizens' wallets
do have their limits...</i>

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:50.960
The issue is the level
of respect for me.

00:12:50.960 --> 00:12:52.560
Wouldn't you agree?

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:56.440
Dad!

00:12:56.440 --> 00:13:00.070
There's someone I want
you to slaughter!

00:13:33.810 --> 00:13:36.800
You're still as
weak as ever, Zoro!

00:13:38.350 --> 00:13:41.010
<i>I promised her...</i>

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:44.680
<i>I can't afford to die
in a place like this!</i>

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:58.870
You again? You sure have
lots of free time.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:01.470
I'll untie you,
so join my crew!

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:02.500
Say what?!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:05.910
I'm looking for people
to join my pirate crew.

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:09.580
Forget it! Me, stooping
to a criminal's level?!

00:14:09.580 --> 00:14:11.380
Screw that!

00:14:11.380 --> 00:14:13.310
What's wrong with
being a pirate?!

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.720
Pirates are despicable!
As if I'd wanna be one!

00:14:15.720 --> 00:14:17.420
Oh, come on!

00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:21.390
You're already known
as an evil bounty hunter!

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:23.660
People can say
whatever they want,

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:27.290
but I ain't done
anything I regret.

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:32.320
<i>I will live through this
and accomplish what I want!</i>

00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:34.870
Yeah?

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:37.500
But I've decided you're
gonna join me!

00:14:37.500 --> 00:14:39.010
Quit deciding on your own!

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:41.070
I hear you use swords.

00:14:41.070 --> 00:14:45.250
Yeah. But that stupid son
took my stuff...

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:47.550
--I'll go get it back for you!
--What?!

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:50.480
So if you want your sword,
join my crew!

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:52.480
You're really getting
on my nerves!

00:14:53.850 --> 00:14:57.560
Is he planning to bust into
the base by himself?!

00:14:57.560 --> 00:15:00.550
You idiot! The base is in
the other direction!

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:06.030
Gum-Gum Rocket!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:10.030
W-who the hell is that guy?!

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:22.680
Alright! Stop there!

00:15:22.680 --> 00:15:25.720
Stand it up in one shot!

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:28.390
Dad! Why aren't you
going to get revenge?!

00:15:28.390 --> 00:15:30.160
The guy hit me!

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:34.090
Not even you've ever
hit me in the face!

00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:39.670
<i>Do you know why I've never
hit you before?</i>

00:15:39.670 --> 00:15:42.900
Eh? Because you think I'm-

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:46.570
Yes. Because you're...

00:15:53.580 --> 00:15:58.590
...a stupid son who isn't
even worth hitting!

00:15:58.590 --> 00:16:00.420
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:16:03.790 --> 00:16:07.990
Your dad is the one
who's great! Me!

00:16:11.060 --> 00:16:15.870
Which reminds me, I hear a rat
snuck into the crucifixion yard.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:19.510
I-i-if you mean that pipsqueak,
I made sure she was dealt with-

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:21.210
You killed her, I hope?!

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:25.310
N-no! I mean, she was
just a little kid...

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:26.980
You, there!

00:16:26.980 --> 00:16:29.250
Go into town
and exterminate her!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:32.020
Y-you can't be serious!
She's just a little girl!

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:34.090
I can't in good conscience...

00:16:34.090 --> 00:16:38.530
Anyone who disobeys my orders
is a traitor, even little brats.

00:16:38.530 --> 00:16:41.360
B-but... I can't do it!

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:47.770
Lieutenant!

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:50.270
<i>Y-you didn't have
to go that far!</i>

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:55.080
It was with my strength that
I rose to my rank of captain!

00:16:55.080 --> 00:16:59.350
Listen! In this world,
titles mean everything!

00:16:59.350 --> 00:17:02.980
That means that I, the captain and
highest ranking officer at this base,

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:07.890
am the most superior person here!

00:17:07.890 --> 00:17:12.390
So everything I do is right!

00:17:12.390 --> 00:17:14.290
Isn't that right, you guys?!

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:16.530
Yes, sir!
You're absolutely correct!

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:19.300
The kid's death
can wait for now.

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:23.240
Observe! This is the symbol
of my authority,

00:17:23.240 --> 00:17:25.810
which took many years
to finally complete!

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:27.470
Now, stand it up!

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:32.000
Display my greatness
at the top of this base!

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:38.550
That's weird.
There's no one here...

00:17:38.550 --> 00:17:43.720
I gotta find that stupid son
and get Zoro's sword back.

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:45.660
Pull! Pull!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:52.490
You, there!

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.690
You bumped it,
didn't you?!

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:00.400
I heard something
up there...

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:04.640
I- I'm sorry, sir!
I was careless!

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:08.620
<i>I told you to think
of this statue as me!</i>

00:18:08.620 --> 00:18:13.150
The slightest scratch or speck
of dirt is treachery against me!

00:18:13.150 --> 00:18:15.020
I'll just check it out!

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:17.820
Gum-Gum...

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:18.990
...Rocket!

00:18:18.990 --> 00:18:20.480
Now you pay!

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:24.060
I jumped too far!

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:27.070
--What is that?!
--It flew up from below!

00:18:27.070 --> 00:18:28.730
I stopped!

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:41.680
Sorry...

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.950
Seize him!
I'm going to kill him!

00:18:46.950 --> 00:18:48.560
Yes, sir!
Right away!

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:51.060
Dad! That's him!
He's the guy who hit me!

00:18:51.060 --> 00:18:53.430
Oh! It's you!

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:54.730
I've been looking for you!

00:18:54.730 --> 00:18:57.930
Come with me! There's something
I want you to give back!

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:59.530
<i>--Let me go!
--Helmeppo-sama!</i>

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:01.840
After him!
Don't let him escape!

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:04.370
Captain! There's someone
in the crucifixion yard!

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:05.700
What?!

00:19:10.480 --> 00:19:13.470
It's one traitor
after the other...

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:19.050
After him!
After him!

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.540
Hurry!

00:19:23.360 --> 00:19:25.350
<i>Someone just had
to interrupt...</i>

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:30.200
Where is Zoro's sword?!

00:19:30.200 --> 00:19:34.230
I'll tell you! I'll tell you!
Just stop dragging me!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.540
Alright! Talk!

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:38.670
In my room...
We just passed it...

00:19:38.670 --> 00:19:42.310
What? Why didn't you say so?
Now we gotta go back.

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:45.350
<i>--Freeze!
--Let Helmeppo-sama go!</i>

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:46.680
No.

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:50.820
Go ahead and shoot,
if you dare!

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:52.480
No! Don't!

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:57.090
<i>Please escape, Zoro-san!</i>

00:19:57.090 --> 00:19:59.690
You'll be killed for doing that,
you know!

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:02.660
I can't stand to watch
the navy like this anymore.

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:06.530
I want to be
an honorable marine!

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:10.340
<i>Stop! I can't escape!
I only got 10 days until-</i>

00:20:10.340 --> 00:20:12.910
You're going to be
executed tomorrow!

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:13.970
What?!

00:20:13.970 --> 00:20:18.610
Helmeppo never once intended
to honor your agreement!

00:20:18.610 --> 00:20:23.120
<i>So Luffy-san got angry
and punched him!</i>

00:20:23.120 --> 00:20:24.380
<i>He did?</i>

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:28.120
<i>The navy is after Luffy-san now.</i>

00:20:28.120 --> 00:20:31.460
I won't ask you to be a pirate.

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:35.450
<i>But please,help Luffy-san!</i>

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:44.140
<i>Luffy-san is the only one
who can save you.</i>

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:50.670
<i>And I think you're also the only
one who can save Luffy-san now.</i>

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:53.640
End of the line!

00:20:56.220 --> 00:20:58.450
For the crime of treachery
against me,

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:01.390
I'll now execute you two
where you stand!

00:21:04.520 --> 00:21:06.190
This the room?!

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:11.430
Bingo!

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:13.670
But there are three here!

00:21:13.670 --> 00:21:16.240
Hey! Which sword is Zoro's?

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:18.260
Oh, he passed out.

00:21:20.270 --> 00:21:21.610
Coby!

00:21:28.380 --> 00:21:31.050
This is some interesting stuff
you guys've pulled!

00:21:31.050 --> 00:21:37.620
Were you two and that straw hat
kid plannin' a coup or something?!

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:40.290
I've always fought alone.

00:21:40.290 --> 00:21:44.730
Unlike arrogant bastards like
you who use soldiers as cronies!

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:46.830
Roronoa Zoro...

00:21:46.830 --> 00:21:49.600
Don't you dare underestimate me!

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:51.100
You may be strong,

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:55.380
but before my authority,
you're as good as scum!

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:57.080
Aim!

00:21:57.080 --> 00:21:58.240
<i>I...</i>

00:22:01.380 --> 00:22:04.220
<i>...can't afford to die here!</i>

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:10.580
You're still as weak
as ever, Zoro!

00:22:12.360 --> 00:22:14.660
Gum-Gum...

00:22:14.660 --> 00:22:15.830
...Rocket!

00:22:15.830 --> 00:22:17.160
Fire!

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:22.400
<i>--What are you-?!
--Luffy-san!</i>

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:23.890
Straw Hat?!

00:22:28.840 --> 00:22:30.740
That doesn't work!

00:22:35.320 --> 00:22:38.020
I told you I was strong!

00:22:38.020 --> 00:22:41.960
W-who the hell are you?!

00:22:41.960 --> 00:22:44.620
I'm Monkey D. Luffy!

00:22:44.620 --> 00:22:47.290
The man who's gonna
be King of the Pirates!

00:22:56.170 --> 00:23:06.170
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.380 --> 00:23:17.320
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.320 --> 00:23:24.490
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:37.030
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.510 --> 00:23:45.520
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.520 --> 00:23:52.590
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.590 --> 00:24:02.590
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
